  "prefLabel": "He-W 842.03 Aid to the Permanently and Totally Disabled Categorical Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 842.03 Aid to the Permanently and Totally Disabled Categorical Requirements.\n\n(a) Applicants and recipients of aid to the permanently and totally disabled (APTD) medical assistance shall meet all aspects of the APTD disability requirement promulgated in RSA 167:6, VI for initial and continuing eligibility.\n\n(b) Recipients of APTD medical assistance shall be transferred to OAA medical assistance the month following the month in which the recipient turns 65.\n\nSource. #13893, eff 2-27-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-w800.html"
